AmbireRecoveryActionIsAuthorityTest
├── when the privilege is one
│   └── it should return true
├── when the privilege is two
│   └── it should return true
├── when the privilege is zero
│   └── it should return false
├── when the privilege is three
│   └── it should return false
├── when the privilege is the entry point marker
│   └── it should return false
├── when the privilege is a validator binding
│   └── it should return false
├── when the privilege has a one in the high byte
│   └── it should return false
├── when the privilege is any other value
│   └── it should return false
├── when the account has no code
│   └── it should revert
└── when the account returns nothing
    └── it should revert
